-- title:
--   Artin symbol of a principal ideal on roots of unity
-- statement:
--   Let $K$ and $M$ be number fields with $M$ an extension of $K$ that is Galois, and assume the Galois group $M \simeq_{\mathrm{alg}[K]} M$ is commutative as a group. Let $n$ be a natural number and $\zeta \in M$ with $\zeta^{n} = 1$, and let $\alpha \in \mathcal{O}_K$ be non-zero with the property that no height-one prime $v$ of $\mathcal{O}_K$ containing $\alpha$ contains $n$. Form the automorphism $\mathrm{raySymbol}$ attached to the family $v \mapsto \mathrm{artinFrob}\,K\,M\,v$ and to the fractional ideal of $K$ generated by the ideal $(\alpha) = \mathrm{span}\{\alpha\}$: by definition this is the (finite) product $\prod_{v}^{\mathrm{f}} (\mathrm{artinFrob}\,K\,M\,v)^{\mathrm{count}_v}$ over the height-one primes $v$ of $\mathcal{O}_K$, the exponent being the $v$-adic count of that fractional ideal, and $\mathrm{artinFrob}\,K\,M\,v$ is the arithmetic Frobenius in $M \simeq_{\mathrm{alg}[K]} M$ at a chosen prime $\mathrm{primeAbove}\,K\,M\,v$ of $\mathcal{O}_M$ lying over $v$. The assertion is that this automorphism sends $\zeta$ to $\zeta^{N}$, where $N =$ `Ideal.absNorm` $(\alpha) = \#(\mathcal{O}_K/(\alpha))$.
--
--   This is the explicit reciprocity law for cyclotomic extensions in the form used here: the Artin symbol of a principal ideal prime to $n$ acts on $n$-th roots of unity by raising to the absolute norm of the ideal. It is used in [`NumberField.exists_artinSymbol_principalUnit_eq_prod_of_isConj`](thm.html#NumberField.exists_artinSymbol_principalUnit_eq_prod_of_isConj) in the Langlands–Tunnell part of the development.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_NumberField_raySymbol_artinFrob_apply_eq_pow_absNorm_of_pow_eq_one.lean

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_LanglandsTunnell_ArtinFrobenius

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

set_option autoImplicit false

open NumberField IsDedekindDomain Deep.NTSupply LanglandsTunnell.P2.Artin
open scoped IsMulCommutative nonZeroDivisors

universe u v

theorem NumberField.raySymbol_artinFrob_apply_eq_pow_absNorm_of_pow_eq_one
    (K : Type u) (M : Type v) [Field K] [NumberField K] [Field M] [NumberField M] [Algebra K M]
    [IsGalois K M] [IsMulCommutative (M ≃ₐ[K] M)]
    (n : ℕ) (ζ : M) (hζ : ζ ^ n = 1) (α : 𝓞 K) (hα : α ≠ 0)
    (hcop : ∀ v : HeightOneSpectrum (𝓞 K), α ∈ v.asIdeal → (n : 𝓞 K) ∉ v.asIdeal) :
    raySymbol K (artinFrob K M) (((Ideal.span {α} : Ideal (𝓞 K)) : FractionalIdeal (𝓞 K)⁰ K)) ζ
      = ζ ^ Ideal.absNorm (Ideal.span ({α} : Set (𝓞 K))) := by sorry
